From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tsuji Riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:14:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/28] ARM: dts: Add Celestial CNC1800L and D-Link DSM-232

Add the CNC1800L SoC (timers, DesignWare APB interrupt controller and
UARTs) and the DSM-232 board with a serial console.

mem=137M is in the bootargs: the vendor U-Boot passes ATAG_MEM for
256MB and ARM_ATAG_DTB_COMPAT replaces the DT memory node with it,
which would hand the regions of the vendor firmware to Linux.

Signed-off-by: Tsuji Riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
